  "title": "React 19 upgrade for console-lab and console-ui",
  "summary": "Bumps the React runtime from 18.3.1 to 19.3.1 in the console-lab app and the console-ui package, moving console-ui's peer range to ^19.3.1 and re-resolving the lockfile so react-aria-components, react-aria, react-stately, @react-types/shared, use-sync-external-store and @testing-library/react all bind against the new React. The lockfile drops the React 18 chain (loose-envify, scheduler 0.23.2) and adds react-dom 19.3.1 with scheduler 0.28.0. No application source changes; the blast radius is the dependency graph of the two console packages.",
